# When this file exists, Vercel uses it (not .gitignore) to decide what to upload
# on `vercel deploy`. The owner snapshot is GITIGNORED but MUST reach the owner
# deployment, so it is intentionally NOT listed here. The local SQLite database,
# environment files, and build output must never be uploaded -- they are.
#
# This file governs EVERY deployment. Both deployment channels are hand-run
# from this tree with the Vercel CLI; nothing bypasses these rules. The GitHub
# Actions workflow in .github/workflows/ci.yml runs typecheck, lint, tests and
# a build on pushes and pull requests -- it never deploys and never uploads.
# If a prebuilt or CI deploy path is ever added, update this comment in the
# same change -- a stale exemption note here is how an upload rule gets
# assumed away.

node_modules
.next
.git
.vercel

# Local-only data & secrets -- never upload.
data
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
.env
.env.*

# AI assistant / local tooling files.
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
.claude
.cursorrules
.pre-push-review-passed
.release-test-passed
